'
' A window for any report: one ReportViewer with no Report property. The caller makes the report
' (rptSales.Report, rptOrderList.Report), gives it its data, and shows it here with
' r.ShowIn( f.rvReport.Handle ). The report must outlive the window: declare it first.
#module "frmReport"
